        "y": 80
      },
      "data": {
        "label": "填槽与定位",
        "description": "分批填槽与定位",
        "icon": "idea",
        "color": "blue",
        "prompt": "填槽：按 plan 逐槽定位取值，写 `machine/report_slots.json` 与 `machine/report_spans.json`（page+quote）。\n**≤10 槽/次、每批落盘**；ND 原样保留；不可辨标 unlocated；不判 PASS/FAIL。"
      }
    },
